## Why CC BY 4.0 for the specification surface

PKAF is a public-interest data ontology intended for use by search engines,
wikis, form builders, workflow engines, case systems, content management,
AI assistants, publication tools, auditing tools, and knowledge graphs.
CC BY 4.0 maximizes reuse and derivative work while requiring attribution
back to the canonical specification, which serves the integrity of the
"evidence-backed assertion" claim PKAF makes.

